# Build Outputs
dist/
build/
web-build/
*.pyc

# INFRA-354: supabase/functions/vendor/ is committed on purpose so the
# `Edge Functions (Deno)` gate resolves without touching the network. esm.sh mirrors
# each package's own layout, so the `dist/` and `build/` rules above — meant for OUR
# build output — also match vendored paths like
# vendor/esm.sh/jose@5.9.6/denonext/dist/... and silently drop 72 of the tree's 108
# files. A clean checkout then fails closed with "Specifier not found in cache".
# Re-include the directories here; do NOT narrow the rules above, which are correct
# for everything else.
!supabase/functions/vendor/**/dist/
!supabase/functions/vendor/**/build/

